        "sid": "DEU 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko kamakhuwa niko Musa aboolela babaandu ba Isiraeli boosi nga ne baba mu sichiimi ebukwe we luluuchi lwa Yoritani. Baba mu Litooma lia Yoritani siimbi Sufu akari we lukoba lwa Parani lubeka lulala, ne chingoba cha Tofeli, ne Labani, ne Haseroti ne Tisahabu lubeka luluundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luli lukeendo lwe chindaalo ekhumi na ndala, khukeenda khukhwama khu sikulu sia Sinai khukhwola Kadeshi-barinea khubirira khu ngila eye sibala sie bikulu sia Edomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu ndaalo eye khunyoa eye kumwesi kwe khumi na mulala kwe kumwiiko kukhola kamakhumi kane khukhwama nga Baisiraeli ne barura mu Misiri, Musa aboolela babaandu kamalaka koosi niko Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi amuelesia khubaboolela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24+NUM.21.25+NUM.21.26+NUM.21.27+NUM.21.28+NUM.21.29+NUM.21.30+NUM.21.31+NUM.21.32+NUM.21.33+NUM.21.34+NUM.21.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khub. 21.21-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lino liekholekha enyuma wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi khuula Omwami Sihoni owe Baamori owamiianga lukoba lwa Heshiboni, ne Omwami Oku owe Bashani, owamiia mu ngoba cha Asitaroti ne Etrei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa arakikha khukhwinooselia babaandu kamalaka kano ne bolile mu maloba ka Moabu, ebukwe we luluuchi lwa Yoritani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa aloma ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nga ne mwabeele a sikulu sia Sinai Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi Wele wefwe akhuboolela efwe ali, ‘Mwamenyile siise sileeyi a sikulu ano mwanyalile murio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kobolayo mala muchiililile ne lukeendo. Cha mu sibala sie bikulu sie Baamori nende be bibala biili siimbi bioosi bali mu litooma lia Yoritani. Cha mwole mu sibala sie bikulu ne sie mumaayo, mwole mu ngoongo che bunafubo nende sia nyanja eya Mediterenia. Cha mu sibala sia Kanaani engelekha we bikulu bia Lebanoni khukhwola khu luuchi luboofu lwa Efurati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola namuele enywe kamaloba kano. Yingilamo mala mubukule kamaloba niko Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi echuba khua bakuuka benywe Aburahamu, Isaaka ne Yakobo. Alaka khubaelesia nibo ne lisaaye liabwe enyuma wabwe.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Musa arobora bakhalaki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa aboolela babaandu ali, “Siise esio, namuboolela ndi, ‘Kimilimo kie khumurangirira enywe kili kimikali lukali khwise. Ese senyala nakikhola seng'ene tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe amukholile muli bakali nga ching'enieesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lekha Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owe bakuuka benywe, amukhole mutasiikhe mube chielefu khukhilakhoo mala amubiite chikhabi nga ne amulaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ese seng'ene se nyala busiro bwenywe, butinyu ne bulomani tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Robora babaandu bakesi, be limanya lundi babakholakho kimilimo kino khukhwama buli mu kholo mala ese ndabakhola babe babemeelesi benywe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne enywe mwafukiilila muli nilio naloma liaba lilayi khukhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio ese nabukula babaandu bakesi lundi bakholile kimilimo bamanya nibo enywe mwarobora khukhwama mu kholo chenywe mala ese nabara mu bwimeelesi khwinywe. Balala baba babemeelesi be babaandu eelefu ndala, babaandi be babaandu emia, babaandi be babaandu kamakhumi karaano ne babaandi be babaandu ekhumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ne siise esio naboolela bakhalaki benywe ndi, ‘Rekeeresia kamalilo ke babaandu mala mukhole bukhalaki bubwenyekha akari we Baisiraeli babili namwe akari wo Omuisiraeli ne omukwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khola kakenyekha mu bukhalaki bwenywe. Khalakila be asi nende be bunyali nga kenyekha. Mukharia omundu yesi yesi tawe, sikila bukhalaki nibwo mukhola buli bwa Wele. Reera kimisaango kimiaandalafu khwise ne ese ndakhalaka.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siise esio ese namulaka koosi niko mukhoyela khukhola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bayooti barumwa khukhwama Kadeshi Barinea",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Khwakhola niko Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi Wele wefwe akhulaka. Khwarura a sikulu sia Sinai mala khwabira mu sichiimi sibalaayi esio sioosi, lundi siriisia. Khwabirira mu sibala sie bikulu sie Baamori. Nga ne khwola Kadeshi-barinea, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "namuboolela enywe ndi, ‘Mwolile mu sibala sie bikulu sie Baamori nisio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi Wele wefwe alikho akhuelesia efwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi Wele wefwe areere sibala sino ebweeni wenywe. Cha musibukule sibe sisienywe, nga Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi we bakuuka benywe ne amulaka. Mukharia, namwe mwarangararwa tawe!’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nenywe mweesi mwanjichakho mala mwaloma muli, ‘Lekha khurume babaandu ebweeni wefwe bache bayoote sibala nio bakhuboolele engila endayi khukhila choosi niyo khubirirakho ne chingoba nicho khukhoyeele khuchemo.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Enganakani eyo yaba endayi. Nono narobora babaandu ekhumi na babili, mulala khukhwama mu buli kholo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bacha mu sibala sie bikulu khukhwola khu Litooma lia Eshikoli mala basiyoota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukobola bakhureerera efwe malala khu matuunda niko banyoolayo. Bakhuboolela bali kamaloba niko Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi Wele wefwe alikho akhuelesia efwe kali kamalayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
