          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.9.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Likh. 9.23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.3.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Baeb. 3.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Kakhaba kario, enywe se mwacha tawe. Mwaba ne sileka khu malaka ka Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe mala mweulung'unyila mu maeema kenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaloma muli, ‘Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi akhubiila efwe. Elio nilio liliakila akhurusia mu sibala sie e Misiri akhure mu bunyali bwe Baamori mala bakhubunie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulikho khucha waena? Balebe befwe nibo khwaruma bakhukholile khwariire. Bakhuboolele bali, Babaandu abo bali bakali lundi baleeyi khu khukhila efwe. Chingoba chabwe chili chimboofu, che kamasiisi kakoola mwikulu. Khutasa khwako khuboone babaandu baboofu lundi be kamaani ebweeneyo.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nese namuboolela ndi, ‘Mukharia babaandu abo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe alamurangirira mala omwene alamupanila. Kalaba bulayi bwene nga akhola e Misiri ne muloleleele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bikh. 13.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ne mwabone mu sichiimi nga ne amureerire mu muleembe khu lukeendo, oli paapa ne ameema omwana wewe. Aakholile ario khu lukeendo lwenywe lwoosi khukhwola abuundu ano.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.3.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Baeb. 3.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ne kakhaba kario, se mweyikina Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi buli lwosi amurangiriranga ebweeni, khumuyiimila abuundu niio mukhola ekambi ne khumwekesia enywe engila. Arangiranga ebweeni wenywe mu silo mu mulilo ne kumuusi amurangirira mu lileesi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aelesia Isiraeli siiukuumo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.33",
